@BankRUs.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### Öppna konto

POST https://localhost:8000/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "socialSecurityNumber": "189001109819",
  "email": "john@doe.com"
}

### Öppna bankkonto
POST https://localhost:8000/api/bank-accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "cf189338-51ab-4327-8cba-f363bd623ce3",
  "name": "Semesterkonto"
}


### Hämta alla konton för en användare

GET https://localhost:8000/api/accounts/fafc87e2-344d-4023-9444-90f181d4b133


### Logga in / Autentisera

POST https://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john@doe.com",
  "password": "Secret#1"
}

### Hämta kontouppgifter

GET https://localhost:8000/api/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..PTUw5ObddGQKWLDEmpvkSS9681iemNAWS6ltDD0wOoc



### Login as CustomerService
POST https://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "service@test.com",
  "password": "Secret#1"
}

